      "created_at": "2011-08-30T22:07:07.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>This is definitely something we tried out during playtesting, and we found that it is actually not as much fun as you might think as it slows the game down a lot and is not terribly balanced.  If you have 6 players, you are better off playing 2 3 player games (that’s one of the reasons there are so many cards in the box <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=9\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\"> )</p>",
