      "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote no-group\" data-username=\"&quot;&quot;Paul&quot;&quot;\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n \"\"Paul\"\":</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>If you have 6 players, you are better off playing 2 3 player games (that’s one of the reasons there are so many cards in the box <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slight_smile.png?v=12\" title=\":slight_smile:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slight_smile:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"> )</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Yeah, good idea… but I first need someone who already know the game and english or I must switch from one game to another every turn <img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/smiley.png?v=12\" title=\":smiley:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":smiley:\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\"></p>\n<p>It’s time for Sentinels+English lessons to my brother!!!</p>",
