      "created_at": "2011-09-01T16:01:20.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, my friends and I bounced around the idea of doing two villains at once, but I told them we’d be better off doing endurance mode if we’ve got more than five players. Obviously we’d keep our health the same, but which would make more sense: keeping all of the cards we’ve already got as they are, or shuffling our decks and starting from scratch?</p>",
